briefing = Array[String]([
"Three border towns are registering for Iron rail permits nobody in Meridian ever approved. That is Konrad Vale's paperwork, and paperwork is how he takes ground without a shot.",
"Nia Rowan does not have to fight for the towns. She has to sit on all three before the permits do."
])
