"All three towns fly Meridian colours when the ink would have dried. Vale's rail office has nothing left to file.",
"Rowan does not think this is the last quiet annexation attempted this season."
])
defeat = "One town too many went through on paper, and the frontier is a little less Meridian's than the map says."
